---
/**
 * Disclaimer (App_Flow §A.1; PRD Rules 11, 12, 15). LegalLayout, no ads.
 * Repeats the accuracy note shown with every result (DisclaimerNote, full variant) and
 * carries the advertising and affiliate disclosure that PRD Rule 15 requires on the page.
 *
 * LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED before launch (Engineering_Plan: agent audit items). If an
 * affiliate program is joined, check its rules for required wording. Amazon Associates,
 * for example, requires its own exact statement about qualifying purchases, and that
 * wording must be added here and wherever the links appear.
 */
import DisclaimerNote from '../components/common/DisclaimerNote.astro';
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';

const description =
  'Beautally gives estimates, not guarantees. Read how to use the results, and how we handle ads and shop links.';
---

<LegalLayout title="Disclaimer" description={description} path="/disclaimer/" updated="2026-11-15">
  <DisclaimerNote variant="full" />

  <h2>Estimates, not guarantees</h2>
  <p>
    Beautally gives estimates. We build them from the sizes you enter and from common coverage,
    waste and pack-size figures. We cannot see your room, so we cannot promise a result.
  </p>

  <h2>What affects your real amount</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Rough, porous or uneven surfaces use more paint than smooth ones.</li>
    <li>Walls that are not square, and cutting around corners, add waste to flooring and tile.</li>
    <li>Patterns, and the distance before a pattern repeats, change how much wallpaper you use.</li>
    <li>Different brands cover different areas. Read the label on the product you choose.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Before you buy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Measure again. A small mistake in a measurement grows through the calculation.</li>
    <li>
      Check the coverage and pack size on the product you plan to buy, and change them in the
      Assumptions panel.
    </li>
    <li>Buy everything of one product at the same time, so colour and pattern match.</li>
    <li>Ask a supplier or a qualified tradesperson if the job is large, unusual or costly.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Not professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Beautally and its guides are for general information. They are not professional, building,
    safety or financial advice. Follow the instructions of the product maker and the rules that
    apply to your home.
  </p>

  <h2>Costs</h2>
  <p>
    A cost appears only when you type a price. It is an estimate made from your price and the
    quantity to buy. Real shop prices, offers, delivery and tax may differ.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising and shop links</h2>
  <p>
    Beautally may be supported by advertising. Ads are labelled Advertisement. They never appear in
    the room form or in your results.
  </p>
  <p>
    Some links to shops may be affiliate links. If you buy through one, we may earn a commission at
    no extra cost to you. These links are marked as sponsored. Having a link does not mean we have
    tested or endorse the product.
  </p>

  <h2>More</h2>
  <p>
    See also the <a href="/terms/">terms of use</a> and the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
